M5SkhXTFZoSjN5YzJTblYtY0RUSTZmaWY2WnVFYmltZElKQmR6b3R1a3poYjVCdmJ6NzdqdDI5T0xXQkF1WktIZnNqb1lMYVk0S01pcm1mZVBDMzlKMVpVRlVxVS1WcWl6Ry1hbS1BX3M?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"儘管現金流量上升，SBA Communications (SBAC) 股票可能仍然合理"},{"title":"Raymond James raises SBA Communications stock price target on lower tax outlook","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-05","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1034054/000103405426000002/sbac-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a leading independent owner and operator of wireless communications infrastructure, including tower structures, rooftops, and other structures that support antennas used for wireless communications, which we collectively refer to as \"towers\" or \"sites.\" Our principal operations are in the United States and its territories. In addition, we own and operate towers in South America, Central America, and Africa. During the year ended December 31, 2025, we sold all of our towers and ended our operations in both the Philippines and Colombia and sold substantially all of our operations in Canada. Our primary business line is our site leasing business, which contributed 97.9% of our total segment operating profit for the year ended December 31, 2025. In our site leasing business, we (1) lease space to wireless service providers and other customers on assets that we own or operate and (2) m","zh":"我們是無線通訊基礎設施的領先獨立所有者和營運商，包括塔式結構、屋頂和其他支援無線通訊天線的結構，我們統稱為「塔」或「站點」。我們的主要業務位於美國及其領土。此外，我們在南美洲、中美洲和非洲也擁有並經營塔樓。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的年度，我們出售了所有塔樓，結束了在菲律賓和哥倫比亞的業務，並出售了在加拿大的幾乎所有業務。我們主要的業務線是我們的站點租賃業務，占我們截至2025年12月31日止年度的分部營業利潤總額的97.9%。在我們的站點租賃業務中，我們(1)向無線服務提供者和其他客戶租賃我們擁有或經營的資產的空間，以及(2)"},{"en":"Our primary strategy is to continue to focus on expanding our site leasing business through organic growth and expansion of our tower portfolio to create shareholder value. We believe that the long-term and repetitive nature of our site leasing business will permit us to maintain a stable, recurring cash flow stream and reduce our exposure to cyclical changes in customer spending which arises in our site development business. We believe that our tower operations are highly scalable. Consequently, we believe that we are able to materially increase our domestic and international tower portfolio without proportionately increasing selling, general, and administrative expenses. Key elements of our strategy include:","zh":"我們的主要策略是繼續專注於透過有機成長和擴大我們的塔樓投資組合來擴大我們的場地租賃業務，以創造股東價值。我們相信，我們的場地租賃業務的長期性和重複性將使我們能夠保持穩定、經常性的現金流，並減少我們因場地開發業務而產生的客戶支出週期性變化的風險。我們相信我們的塔式營運具有高度可擴展性。因此，我們相信，我們能夠在不相應增加銷售、一般和管理費用的情況下大幅增加我們的國內和國際鐵塔投資組合。我們策略的關鍵要素包括："},{"en":"Maximizing our Tower Capacity. We generally have constructed or acquired towers that accommodate multiple tenants and a majority of our towers are high-capacity tower structures. Most of our towers have significant capacity available for additional antennas, and we believe that increased use of our towers' structural capacity can generate additional lease revenue and be achieved at a low incremental cost. We measure the available capacity of our existing sites to support additional tenants by assessing several factors, including tower height, tower type, wind loading, environmental conditions, existing equipment on the tower and zoning and permitting regulations in effect in the jurisdiction where the tower is located. We actively market space on our towers through our internal sales force. As of December 31, 2025, we had an average of 1.8 tenants per site.","zh":"最大化我們的塔容量。我們通常建造或收購可容納多個租戶的塔樓，而我們的大部分塔樓均為高容量塔樓結構。我們的大多數塔都有足夠的容量可用於額外的天線，我們相信，增加使用我們的塔的結構容量可以產生額外的租賃收入，並以較低的增量成本實現。我們透過評估多個因素來衡量現有場地支援額外租戶的可用容量，包括塔樓高度、塔樓類型、風荷載、環境條件、塔樓上的現有設備以及塔樓所在司法管轄區有效的分區和許可法規。我們透過內部銷售團隊積極行銷塔樓空間。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們每個站點平均有 1.8 位租戶。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our primary focus is the leasing of antenna space on our multi-tenant towers to a variety of wireless service providers under long-term lease contracts in the United States, South America, Central America, and Africa. We derive site leasing revenues primarily from wireless service provider tenants. Wireless service providers enter into (1) individual tenant site leases with us, each of which relates to the lease or use of space at an individual site or (2) master lease agreements (\"MLAs\") with us, which provide for the material terms and conditions that will apply to multiple sites; although, in most cases, each individual site under an MLA is also governed by its own site leasing agreement which sets forth pricing and other site specific terms. Our site leasing business generates substantially all of our total segment operating profit, representing 97.4% or more of our total segment ope","zh":"我們的主要重點是根據長期租賃合約將多租戶塔上的天線空間租賃給美國、南美洲、中美洲和非洲的各種無線服務供應商。我們的站點租賃收入主要來自無線服務提供者租戶。無線服務提供者與我們簽訂 (1) 單一租戶站點租賃，每項租賃都涉及單一站點空間的租賃或使用，或 (2) 與我們簽訂的主租賃協議（「MLA」），其中規定了適用於多個站點的重要條款和條件；儘管在大多數情況下，MLA 下的每個單獨場地也受其自己的其他場地租賃協議的約束，該協議規定了特定條款和其他站點特定條款。我們的場地租賃業務幾乎佔據了我們分部總營業利潤的大部分，佔分部總營業利潤的 97.4% 或更多"},{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, we owned 17,394 sites in the United States and its territories. For the year ended December 31, 2025, we generated 72.6% of our total site leasing revenue from these sites. We derive domestic site leasing revenues primarily from T-Mobile, AT&T Wireless, and Verizon Wireless. In the United States, our tenant leases are generally for an initial term of five years to ten years with multiple renewal periods at the option of the tenant. These tenant leases typically contain specific annual rent escalators, including renewal option periods. Our ground leases and other property interests in the United States are generally for an initial term of five years or more with multiple renewal periods, which are at our option, and provide for specific annual rent escalators. As of December 31, 2025, no U.S. state or territory accounted for more than 10% of our total tower portfo","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們在美國及其領土擁有 17,394 個站點。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度，我們的場地租賃總收入的 72.6% 來自這些場地。我們的國內站點租賃收入主要來自 T-Mobile、AT&T Wireless 和 Verizon Wireless。在美國，我們的租戶租約的初始期限通常為五年到十年，租戶可選擇多次續約。這些租戶租約通常包含特定的年租金階梯，包括續約選擇期。我們在美國的地面租賃和其他財產權益的初始期限通常為五年或更長，並有多個續約期（由我們選擇），並規定了具體的年租金階梯。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，美國沒有一個州或領地的鐵塔數量佔超過 10%"}],"customers":[{"en":"We depend on a relatively small number of customers for our site leasing and site development revenues. The following customers represented at least 10% of our total revenues during the last three years:","zh":"我們的場地租賃和場地開發收入依賴相對較少的客戶。以下客戶在過去三年中至少占我們總收入的 10%："},{"en":"In addition to the Big 3 wireless carriers (T-Mobile, AT&T Wireless, Verizon Wireless), we also provided services or leased space to a number of other customers during 2025 including:","zh":"除了三大無線營運商（T-Mobile、AT&T Wireless、Verizon Wireless）之外，我們還在 2025 年向許多其他客戶提供服務或租賃空間，包括："}],"competition":[{"en":"Domestic Site Leasing – In the U.S., our primary competitors for our site leasing activities are (1) large independent tower companies including American Tower Corporation and Crown Castle International; (2) a number of regional independent tower owners; (3) wireless service providers that own and operate their own towers and lease, or may in the future decide to lease, antenna space to other providers; (4) owners and operators of alternative facilities such as rooftops, outdoor and indoor distributed antenna system (\"DAS\") networks, billboards, utility poles, and electric transmission towers; and (5) owners and operators of alternative wireless technology systems and architectures.","zh":"國內場地租賃 – 在美國，我們場地租賃活動的主要競爭對手是 (1) 大型獨立鐵塔公司，包括 American Tower Corporation 和 Crown Castle International；（2） 若干區域性獨立鐵塔業主；(3) 擁有並經營自己的發射塔並向其他供應商租賃或將來可能決定租賃天線空間的無線服務供應商；(4) 屋頂、室外和室內分散式天線系統 (DAS.S.替代無線技術系統和架構的所有者和運營商。"},{"en":"International Site Leasing – Internationally, our competition consists of wireless service providers that own and operate their own tower networks, large multinational, national, and regional independent tower companies, and alternative facilities such as rooftop, outdoor and indoor networks, billboards, utility poles, and electric transmission towers.","zh":"國際站點租賃—在國際上，我們的競爭對手包括擁有並經營自己的塔網路的無線服務供應商、大型跨國、國家和地區獨立塔公司，以及屋頂、室外和室內網路、廣告看板、電線桿和輸電塔等替代設施。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Domestic Site Leasing Revenue","val":1865602000,"zh":"國內場地租賃收入"},{"name":"International Site Leasing Revenue","val":705039000,"zh":"國際場地租賃收入"},{"name":"Site Development Construction","val":244498000,"zh":"場地開發建設"}],"total":2815139000}},"peers":["CCI","AMT","EQIX","VRSK","EXR"]}}